WEBVTT

00:00:09,260 --> 00:00:14,300
PET scan is clear. What does this physiological

00:00:14,300 --> 00:00:17,500
avidity throughout mean?

00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:24,580
So I think you're asking a question about when the radiologist

00:00:24,580 --> 00:00:27,180
says physiology, physiologic

00:00:27,180 --> 00:00:32,220
avidity throughout meaning that he that just I believe means that he's able to

00:00:32,220 --> 00:00:34,360
see what he was looking for.

00:00:34,360 --> 00:00:38,660
So if everything is clear on your PET scan

00:00:38,660 --> 00:00:43,960
nothing is nothing is lighting up on the PET scan, that's a good thing.

00:00:43,960 --> 00:00:48,660
But just like we talked about and I not trying to burst a bubble,

00:00:48,660 --> 00:00:53,380
but I just want to say this is just one test.

00:00:53,380 --> 00:00:57,220
So don't I think people have made the mistake of listening to their

00:00:57,220 --> 00:01:01,860
oncologists and say, oh, great, your cancer free.

00:01:01,860 --> 00:01:06,220
And then, you know, they can let down their guard and not treat

00:01:06,220 --> 00:01:11,980
themselves as if they have cancer and not that we want to ever

00:01:11,980 --> 00:01:17,260
act in fear or anything like that, but we also want to act in wisdom.

00:01:17,260 --> 00:01:22,380
So we don't let out our trust in our heavenly Father that he is the one

00:01:22,380 --> 00:01:27,020
healing us, the one who who is sustaining us.

00:01:27,020 --> 00:01:32,460
And I know you who are asking this question, who would never do this

00:01:32,460 --> 00:01:35,980
anyhow, but you're keeping your faith in him that he's going

00:01:35,980 --> 00:01:43,420
to continue to sustain every physiological process every every millisecond

00:01:43,420 --> 00:01:44,020
of the day.

00:01:44,020 --> 00:01:46,740
So that's great news.

00:01:46,740 --> 00:01:50,020
It's fantastic news, but we keep up the course.

